---
const { items = [] } = Astro.props;
---

<section id="how" class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
  <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-xl shadow-slate-100 sm:p-10">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">How Does Essential Tech Help?</h1>
    <h5 class="mt-5 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-secondary">Pay only for what You need When You need iT</h5>
    <p class="mt-6 text-base leading-7 text-slate-600">
      Lets face it as a small business owner you probably have better things to worry about than the tech that you need to run your business.&nbsp; Honestly you probably only care about two things: Is it Effectively being used&nbsp;and is it Efficiently being delivered.&nbsp; There is nothing worse in your mind than paying too much for tech when all you really need are the Essentials .&nbsp; &nbsp; Thats why we think our Essential Tech Support Service is the perfect fit for small businesses just like yours.&nbsp; We cover the essentials you need at an affordable monthly rate and provide you with the support you need when you need it.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-3">
      <article class="group rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/10 to-transparent p-6 transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1">
        <img src="https://essentialtechhelp.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/002-video-conference.png" alt="" class="h-12 w-12" loading="lazy" />
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-base font-bold text-slate-900">SECURITY</h3>
      </article>
      <article class="group rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-secondary/10 to-transparent p-6 transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1">
        <img src="https://essentialtechhelp.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/003-web-programming.png" alt="" class="h-12 w-12" loading="lazy" />
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-base font-bold text-slate-900">BACKUP</h3>
      </article>
      <article class="group rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/10 to-transparent p-6 transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1">
        <img src="https://essentialtechhelp.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/004-rocket.png" alt="" class="h-12 w-12" loading="lazy" />
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-base font-bold text-slate-900">SUPPORT</h3>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
